## DevHub workflow — owner policy

The canonical checkout is `F:/code/devhub`; its mode, checks and worktree folder are in [.devhub/worktree.json](F:/code/devhub/.devhub/worktree.json). The owner's rules for this machine (dev servers only through DevHub, project modes, temporary worktrees, leaving nothing behind) are kept once, in `F:/code/AGENTS.md`; `F:/worktrees/AGENTS.md` and the global agent instructions carry the same text. Read them before changing repository state.
